:name: nRF52840
:description: Default Renode machine for any board on the nRF52840 SoC.
:
: Included by renode-nrf-run, which sets $elf beforehand and wires the UART to a
: PTY afterwards -- so this file only describes the machine. A project can
: replace it with <app>/boards/<board>.resc (e.g. boards/nrf52840dk.resc) to
: add sensors or other nodes.

using sysbus
mach create "nrf52840"
machine LoadPlatformDescription @platforms/cpus/nrf52840.repl

macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF $elf
"""
runMacro $reset
